    "background_story": "Stephanie had always felt a sense of restlessness, as if there was something more out there for her. After completing college, she embarked on a journey of self-discovery, seeking answers to life's big questions. She traveled to distant lands, immersing herself in different cultures and meeting people from all walks of life. Stephanie's insatiable curiosity led her to try new experiences, from meditation and yoga to painting and writing. As she wandered, she began to uncover her true passions and values. Her seeking nature eventually led her to a small village in Nepal, where she discovered a sense of community and belonging. There, she co-founded a sustainable education initiative, empowering local women and children. Stephanie's journey was a testament to the power of seeking, and the incredible things that can happen when we follow our hearts.",
